  "releaseNotes": "v1.5.1: documentation and packaging patch - every public member now carries XML documentation (CS1591 is enforced as a build error) and the README was reviewed for accuracy. Previous release: v1.5.0 - KafkaOptions are validated through IValidateOptions - an empty BootstrapServers or GroupId, a non-positive BatchSize or a negative attempt/linger setting fails at startup instead of degrading at runtime. Full documentation & release notes: https://quoclinh.id.vn/docs/linkit",
